api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-09T23:48:34Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T15:37:59Z","closed_at":"2025-10-10T15:37:56Z","assignee":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.dev 295e465fe403954911ca75145cc5d21546274262\n- Not reproducible in: 4.5.stable, 4.6.dev1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (d413181b8) - Fedora Linux 42 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.82.09) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nBaking lightmaps in Compatibility no longer works in `master` (it still works in Forward+/Mobile). I bisected the regression to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97151. cc @devloglogan \n\n4.5.stable | `master`\n-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40973fdc-d6c1-485a-b709-0039c1121fc4\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3b3394c-b471-4139-ab98-3d33651ce947\" />\n\nAfter baking lightmaps, this is printed:\n\n```\n[...]\n1039: \tgl_Position = clip_position;\n1040: }\n1041: \n1042: /* clang-format off */\n1043: \n1044: \n  ERROR: drivers/gles3/shader_gles3.cpp:259 - SceneShaderGLES3: Vertex shader compilation failed:\n  ERROR: 0(878) : error C1503: undefined variable \"uv2_attrib_input\"\n  ERROR: 0(880) : error C1503: undefined variable \"uv2_attrib_input\"\n  ERROR: \n  ERROR: drivers/gles3/shader_gles3.cpp:353 - Method/function failed.\n  ERROR: drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp:1962 - Parameter \"texture\" is null.\n\n```\n\nLightmaps baked in another renderer (or from Compatibility on a working version) will still render correctly though.\n\nNote that the last printed message is not related to the bug, it still happens on working versions ans is presumably related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/94407. 4.5.stable\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Bake a LightmapGI node when using the Compatibility renderer.\n- Look at the editor Output panel for errors, as well as the lightmap not appearing correctly.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_lightmap_bake_compatibility.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22812653/test_lightmap_bake_compatibility.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111465/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}